==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪmɪŋ|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# On fire with visible [[flame]]s.
#: ''The '''flaming''' debris kept the firefighter well back, and the sparks threatened the neighborhood.''
# {{context|colloquial|lang=en}} Extremely obvious; visibly evident. Typically of a [[homosexual]] male.
#: ''To call him a '''flaming''' homosexual would be an understatement, but I think he acts that way just to see people react.''
# {{context|British|colloquial|lang=en}} [[damned|Damned]], [[bloody]].
#: ''I wasted three hours in that '''flaming''' traffic jam!''

